    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>August 8th, International Tanghulu Day, the emotion of Tanghulu Legend arrives!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I want more Tanghulu!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack more Tanghulu and unlock skins for the girl who loves sweets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Giant Tanghulu: Tanghulu Legend</strong> invites you into the sweet world of tanghulu with a delightful and addictive hyper-casual game! Watch as skewered fruits are coated in dazzling sugar, transforming into fantastic, glittering desserts. Make and admire your very own tanghulu and grow your shop into the top snack spot in Korea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own Tanghulu:</strong> Start with a humble wooden stick and watch your snack evolve into luxurious, unlimited-refill tanghulu. Build efficient production lines and research various toppings and ingredients to create special tanghulu unlike anything in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Joy of Unlimited Refills:</strong> Customers will go wild for your unlimited tanghulu refills! But you'll need to find the secret to maintaining exquisite taste while offering endless refills. Strategic ingredient placement, quick reactions, and proper waste sorting are key strategies to boost customer satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Diverse Tanghulu Skins:</strong> Strawberries, tangerines, and Shine Muscats are just the beginning! Make tanghulu with watermelon, blueberries, and even exotic fruits you never imagined. Research and unlock new skins to become a master tanghulu artisan who captivates customers' palates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competition and Challenges:</strong> Compete against other tanghulu shops to earn the title of the best tanghulu spot. Challenge the Steam rankings to earn generous rewards (a sense of accomplishment, satisfaction, love, and peace).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the sweet and thrilling world of a tanghulu hotspot in\u00a0<strong>Big Giant Tanghulu: Tanghulu Legend!</strong>\u00a0It's time to get your tanghulu shop always open and create the legend of unlimited refills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802820/extras/115a5938946b967b7c8a0e86ae9c70e3.avif?t=1754580386\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>By the way, there's no such thing as International Tanghulu Day.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...Just in case you were wondering.</i></p>",
